@startuml 04_change2_factory_method_class
!pragma layout smetana
title Change2 - new pattern instance: Factory Method (parameterized)\n"Vehicle Category Rules Creation" (code after Change4)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor Black
}
hide empty members

class CarTypeService <<Client>> {
  +CreateCarTypeAsync(request : CreateCarTypeRequest) : CarTypeDTO
}
note left of CarTypeService
  Service/CarTypeService.cs:27-59
  calls Create at line 36;
  never names a concrete rules class
end note

interface IVehicleCategoryRulesFactory <<Creator>> {
  +Create(category : VehicleCategory) : IVehicleCategoryRules
}

class VehicleCategoryRulesFactory <<ConcreteCreator>> {
  +Create(category : VehicleCategory) : IVehicleCategoryRules
}
note right of VehicleCategoryRulesFactory
  Service/Categories/VehicleCategoryRulesFactory.cs:15-24
  factory method: switch on category
    STANDARD   -> new StandardCategoryRules()
    ELECTRIC   -> new ElectricCategoryRules()
    COMMERCIAL -> new CommercialCategoryRules()
    otherwise  -> throw ApiException (400)
end note

interface IVehicleCategoryRules <<Product>> {
  +Category : VehicleCategory
  +CalculateSecurityDeposit(dailyRate : double) : double
  +ValidateRates(dailyRate, weeklyRate, monthlyRate) : IReadOnlyList<string>
}

class StandardCategoryRules <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  deposit = 0
  no rate rule
}
class ElectricCategoryRules <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  deposit = dailyRate x 2
  no rate rule
}
class CommercialCategoryRules <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  deposit = dailyRate x 5
  weeklyRate is required
}

enum VehicleCategory {
  STANDARD
  ELECTRIC
  COMMERCIAL
}

CarTypeService --> IVehicleCategoryRulesFactory : asks for rules
CarTypeService ..> IVehicleCategoryRules : uses only the interface
IVehicleCategoryRulesFactory <|.. VehicleCategoryRulesFactory
IVehicleCategoryRules <|.. StandardCategoryRules
IVehicleCategoryRules <|.. ElectricCategoryRules
IVehicleCategoryRules <|.. CommercialCategoryRules
VehicleCategoryRulesFactory ..> StandardCategoryRules : <<create>>
VehicleCategoryRulesFactory ..> ElectricCategoryRules : <<create>>
VehicleCategoryRulesFactory ..> CommercialCategoryRules : <<create>>
VehicleCategoryRulesFactory ..> VehicleCategory : parameter

legend bottom
  Parameterized variant: one concrete creator whose factory method takes a
  parameter identifying the product. There is no creator class hierarchy,
  so some texts call this structure Simple Factory.
  Binding: Program.cs:193-194 registers the factory as a singleton.
endlegend
@enduml
